  <div class="card stack s"><h3>Yuzu-Pack</h3><p class="fg2" style="font-size:.95rem">Alle Karten deines Decks plus deine korrigierten Fehler als Lückentext, Format <span class="mono">yuzu_pack: 1</span>, Kategorie <span class="mono">Language::German::Mephisto</span>, stabile IDs.</p><div class="row"><button class="primary sm" data-act="saveYuzu">${ic("download")} mephisto-core.yuzu.json</button><button class="sm" data-act="copyYuzu">Als Text kopieren</button></div></div>
